target/
*.rs.bk
Cargo.lock.bak
target/
.klang_pkgs/
# Generated during tests: `run`/`check`/`fetch` write klang.lock next to a
# package manifest. No package tracks one (verified: no klang.lock is
# tracked anywhere), so ignore test residue inside stdlib-packages only —
# a future intentionally-tracked lock elsewhere must stay visible.
stdlib-packages/**/klang.lock
# Prebuilt npm binaries are staged by the release workflow from build
# artifacts at publish time – never commit them. (The klang-cli wrapper's
# bin/klang.js launcher stays tracked; only klang-cli-*/bin/ is ignored.)
npm-package/klang-cli-*/bin/
